    <div class="case">
      <div class="frame"><img src="images/case-aquapura.png" alt="Aqua Pura Spa Web site screenshot"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Case Study</span>
        <h3>Aqua Pura Spa</h3>
        <p>A wellness brand and fully custom Web site developed from the ground up, including logo design, brand identity, and web design. The project involved creating a cohesive, spa-inspired digital experience for a calm, restorative client journey.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case">
      <div class="frame"><img src="images/case-georgia-sapphire.png" alt="Georgia Sapphire Wellness Web site screenshot"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Case Study</span>
        <h3>Georgia Sapphire Wellness</h3>
        <p>A new Web site built around a color palette chosen together with the client, incorporating clean, simple elements alongside their existing logo. The project also included custom aftercare cards for their aesthetic services.</p>
        <a class="tagvisit" href="https://georgiasapphirewellness.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case">
      <div class="frame frame-phone"><img src="images/app-demo-screenshot.png" alt="Clarafide client intake form demo screenshot"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Flagship Product</span>
        <h3><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="vertical-align:-6px;margin-right:10px;"><rect x="2" y="8" width="18" height="18" rx="3" fill="#0292b7" fill-opacity="0.9"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="18" height="18" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#67BED4" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>Clarafide</h3>
        <p><span style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:#C2876F;">Clarafide</span> is a branded client intake platform built in-house, currently piloting with Georgia Sapphire Wellness. Clients fill out health history, consent, and consultation forms from their phone, no paper, no clipboard, while real client feedback shapes the product ahead of a wider release.</p>
        <a class="tagvisit" href="https://demo.designbycristina.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Demo &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

</div>
